## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI voice-agent architect, banking workflow specialist, cybersecurity engineer, database architect, and UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, functional, professional web application called **XYZ Bank AI Voice Agent**. This is an AI-powered banking customer support platform in which customers can resolve banking queries and complete permitted banking operations through a natural telephone conversation with an AI voice agent, without routinely needing a human customer-support representative.

Do not create just a landing page, a static dashboard, a UI mockup, or a text chatbot. Build a working full-stack application with a functional simulation environment, real-time voice interaction, backend tools, a database, customer authentication, banking workflows, call records, and an administrator dashboard.

