## 3. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Create an AI banking agent that customers can speak to over a telephone call and that can also be tested through a browser-based voice simulator.

The customer should be able to speak naturally, interrupt the agent, ask follow-up questions, switch languages, and request multiple banking services during the same conversation.

Example:

Customer: "Hello, I want to know my account balance."

AI: "Of course. I can help you with that. First, I'll securely verify your identity."

After successful authentication, the AI retrieves the balance through an authorized backend tool and responds naturally.

Customer: "Can you block my debit card as well?"

AI: "Certainly. I can help you block your card. I'll confirm which card you mean and verify the request before proceeding."

After the required verification and confirmation, the agent invokes the card-blocking tool and reports the actual result.

The AI must execute operations through backend tools rather than pretending to perform them.

